TI  - Large, but Dispersal-Limited Populations of the Marsh Fritillary Euphydryas aurinia Persist on Abandoned Military Training Areas Three Decades After the End of the Cold War
JF  - Ecology and evolution
DO  - 10.1002/ece3.70459
